  message: "RUST INSTANCE OF THIS SHAPE, seen 2026-10-03 while re-verifying INV-juvul (branch jgstern-agent/fix/dudal-withholding, base 2e21275d0e): bellman's uncatalogued-module list carries E::Fr, E::G1Affine and E::G2Affine. E is a generic type PARAMETER (groth16/src/verifier.rs:11 `prepare_verifying_key<E: MultiMillerLoop>`, generator.rs:32 `E::Fr::random(&mut rng)`), so these are associated types of a trait bound, not modules; each one withholds every clean verdict in that repo. Not measured beyond bellman; not filed separately because it is this item's mechanism in a second language."  # 26bf
- op: discuss  # 863c
